        "text": "Seasonal and one-off adjustment: August changes in the available official series were small: July to August was -0.4 in 2023, -0.2 in 2024, and 0.0 in 2025. Applying roughly -0.1 to -0.2 to the July 2026 reading of 22.2 gives 22.0-22.1; the stable work-from-home structure argues against a larger mechanical move."
