        "text": "Reference class and base rate: for this change-flow target I anchor on the recent official BLS core CPI-U SA monthly changes themselves. The seven-month reference class average from Dec. 2025 through Jun. 2026 is 1.5 / 7 = 0.214 percent, and the 12-month core rate of 2.6 percent is consistent with a monthly pace near 0.21 percent."
